<title>USA: TABLE - Geerlings &amp; Wade Q2 net profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Geerlings &amp; Wade Q2 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	Two Quarter Period Ended</p>
<p>			  Jun 29,   Jun 30,     Jun 29,     Jun 30,</p>
<p>			     1996     1997	  1996	  1997</p>
<p> Sales	    $7,189,882 $8,402,370 $14,859,989 $15,522,169</p>
<p>Net income (loss)</p>
<p>			(125,815)   265,936   (244,970)     251,687</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per   share		  (0.03)	0.07	(0.06)	  0.07</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>common shares and</p>
<p>equivalents</p>
<p>  outstanding     3,775,555  3,779,391  3,775,555   3,793,686</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it turned a profit in Q2 1997 due to increased sales attributed to a successful spring catalog and telemarketing system; other factors include a strong U.S. dollar and reduced shipping costs.</p>
<p>Full company name is Geerlings &amp; Wade Inc.</p>
